  "records": [
    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">The office of the city clerk shall be open daily except Saturdays, Sundays and legal holidays during such hours as may be established and such additional times as the city clerk may desire.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Rev. Ords. 1962, § 262)</p>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">Charter reference—</span>Appointment of city clerk, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html#121\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html&amp;anchor=121\">121</a>; duties of city clerk generally, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html#138\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html&amp;anchor=138\">138</a> et seq.</p>",
      "text": "The office of the city clerk shall be open daily except Saturdays, Sundays and legal holidays during such hours as may be established and such additional times as the city clerk may desire. (Rev. Ords. 1962, § 262) Charter reference—Appointment of city clerk, § 121; duties of city clerk generally, § 138 et seq.",
