    {
      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">The records and papers kept or deposited in the city clerk’s office shall be under the exclusive care and control of the city clerk and he shall be responsible for the safekeeping and custody thereof.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Rev. Ords. 1962, § 261)</p>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">Charter reference—</span>City clerk to have charge of records, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html#138\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html&amp;anchor=138\">138</a>.</p>",
      "text": "The records and papers kept or deposited in the city clerk’s office shall be under the exclusive care and control of the city clerk and he shall be responsible for the safekeeping and custody thereof. (Rev. Ords. 1962, § 261) Charter reference—City clerk to have charge of records, § 138.",
