      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">No person, other than the city clerk or his assistants, shall enter the vault where public records and documents are kept without the permission of the city clerk.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Rev. Ords. 1962, § 264)</p>",
      "text": "No person, other than the city clerk or his assistants, shall enter the vault where public records and documents are kept without the permission of the city clerk. (Rev. Ords. 1962, § 264)",
