      "html": "<p class=\"P1\">An officer of the city in an official capacity may examine or consult without charge any public document or record in the custody of the city clerk, subject to the rules and regulations set forth in this article.</p>\n<p class=\"HistoryNote\">(Rev. Ords. 1962, § 267)</p>",
      "text": "An officer of the city in an official capacity may examine or consult without charge any public document or record in the custody of the city clerk, subject to the rules and regulations set forth in this article. (Rev. Ords. 1962, § 267)",
      "tables": [],
